# Scope prettier ignore to the runtime-generated outputs under .qfai so SSOT
# sources (.qfai/specs, .qfai/assistant, .qfai/contracts, .qfai/discussion)
# stay formatted. Negate only the authored files that should remain
# auto-formatted. Historical evidence markdown stays ignored so frozen records
# do not churn under auto-formatting. The parent directory is also explicitly
# un-ignored so the negated file entry survives prettier's gitignore-style
# matching.
.qfai/report/**
!.qfai/report/
!.qfai/report/preflight_summary.md
.qfai/review/**
.qfai/evidence/**
# An archived pack is a frozen record, so reformatting one is churn on a
# document nobody is editing — and `check-pack-locations` reads the changed
# paths, so that churn reports the archive directory as a misplaced pack. The
# markdownlint globs already skip both archives for the same reason.
.qfai/discussion_archive/**
.qfai/review_archive/**
pnpm-lock.yaml
tmp
*.min.js
*.min.css

# Generated QFAI artifacts (not versioned)
.qfai/review/review-*
.qfai/review_archive/review-*
.qfai/evidence/*[0-9]*.md
.qfai/evidence/*[0-9]*.json
.qfai/report/run-*
.qfai/report/validate.*
.qfai/report/report.md
.qfai/report/atdd-traceability
.qfai/report/preflight_summary.md
.qfai/report/specs-coverage
